  migrate <th\0306\0260-m\0341\0273\0245c-1.2> [--yes] [--no-service]   Chuy\0341\0273\0203n h\0341\0273\0207 th\0341\0273\0221ng \0304\0221ang ch\0341\0272\0241y t\0341\0273\0253 th\0306\0260 m\0341\0273\0245c b\0341\0272\0243n 1.2 sang th\0306\0260 m\0341\0273\0245c n\0303\0240y (sao l\0306\0260u, d\0341\0273\0253ng b\0341\0272\0243n c\0305\0251, ch\0303\0251p d\0341\0273\0257 li\0341\0273\0207u, c\0303\0240i)

Xem log
  logs [worker|n8n|agent|all] [-f] [-n S\0341\0273\0220]   M\0341\0272\0267c \0304\0221\0341\0273\0213nh: worker + n8n, 100 d\0303\0262ng cu\0341\0273\0221i. -f: theo d\0303\0265i tr\0341\0273\0261c ti\0341\0272\0277p.

Build
  build [--no-cache]  Build image Docker c\0341\0273\0247a worker
  n8n build           Sinh workflow n8n t\0341\0273\0253 m\0303\0243 (n8n/build.py)
